
Do **not** put your **Raspberry Pi login or sudo password** here — only Git/GitHub credentials below.

Easiest with this repo layout: **`Sequence_iOS/deploy/raspberry-pi/.env`** (chmod 600, never commit).

Recommended (PAT):

GITHUB_TOKEN=

Or HTTPS (**password = PAT**, not GitHub login password):

GIT_USERNAME=

GIT_PASSWORD=

Also supported: **`Sequence_iOS/.env`** (repo root), then **`/etc/sequence/git.env`** — see **`git-env.on-pi.example`**. Later files override earlier when both define the same variable.
